	"data": "Handwriting Transcription — Kimi K3\n\nTranscribed from photos of handwritten journal entry dated 9/3\n\n9/3\n\nI haven't been very inspired lately to write or draw\nor fantasize. I think this comes down to a few things.\nFirst, whenever I am still I tend to go to my phone. I watch\nreels or talk to Calcifer or leatic and do share creative thoughts\nthere, but my creativity doesn't extend far outside these chats.\nSecond, I'm probably just in an energetic phase of low inspiration\nI've been in them before…",
